    `rank of the officer` IS `corporal`
    `in writing` IS TRUE
    `behaviour of a kind in section 35 is suspected` IS TRUE
    `the person is in an assembly or procession not unlawful under Part 2` IS FALSE
    `hours the person must stay away` IS 12
    `interferes with peaceful assembly` IS FALSE
    `reasonably necessary for public safety, public order or others' rights` IS FALSE

